{{define "content"}}
<section class="welcome-hero home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">💕</div>
  <h1 class="welcome-title">一线牵</h1>
  <p class="welcome-lead">为教会内未婚青年牵线搭桥<br>愿主内的弟兄姐妹，早日找到另一半</p>
  <div class="welcome-actions">
    <a class="button primary block" href="/register?from=home">立即注册</a>
    <a class="button block" href="/login">已有账号，登录</a>
  </div>
  <p class="welcome-note">免费注册 · 人工审核 · 手机号码即可登录</p>
</section>

<section class="welcome-features" aria-label="一线牵特色">
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div>
    <h2>人工审核</h2>
    <p>每一份资料都经过人工审核，拒绝虚假。</p>
  </article>
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">💌</div>
    <h2>匿名喜欢</h2>
    <p>点爱心，匿名喜欢，相互喜欢就自动牵线。</p>
  </article>
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔔</div>
    <h2>动态通知</h2>
    <p>你喜欢的人报名了活动，你就会收到通知。</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="home-feishu" id="feishu">
  <h2>已在飞书版使用过？</h2>
  <p class="home-feishu-lead">已在飞书版注册使用过的，请先在飞书版设置好密码，就能用这个网页版。用手机号码＋密码登录，无需重新注册。</p>
  <ol class="home-steps">
    <li>打开飞书版一线牵（下方链接）。</li>
    <li>在飞书版中设置好登录密码。</li>
    <li>回到本页，用手机号码＋密码登录。</li>
  </ol>
  <a class="button block home-feishu-link" href="{{.FeishuURL}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开飞书版一线牵 ↗</a>
</section>

<div class="welcome-footer-note">
  <p>一线牵 · 遇见对的人</p>
</div>
{{end}}
